warning[manual_assign_op]: `total` is updated with `+` spelled out
  --> tests/lint/manual_assign_op/bad.jai:9:5
   |
 9 |     total = total + 5;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `total += 5`
   |
 8       total := 0;
 9 ~     total += 5;
10       s: State;
   |
   = note: `manual_assign_op` is `warn` by default
